msgid "4\\.1\\. Zenoh"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Introspection-and-analysis/Security/Introducing-ros2-security.rst:251
msgid ""
"The RMW implementation Zenoh has its own tools to configure security, in "
"particular a package called `zenoh_security_tools <https://github.com/ros2/"
"rmw_zenoh/tree/rolling/zenoh_security_tools>`_. It contains the "
"``generate_configs`` executable which generates Zenoh session config files "
"with access control, authentication and encryption parameters based on "
"policies and keystores generated using sros2."
msgstr ""

