#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Introspection-and-analysis/Security/Introducing-ros2-security.rst:303
msgid ""
"Leave both nodes running as you use ``ros2cli`` and answer the questions "
"below."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Introspection-and-analysis/Security/Introducing-ros2-security.rst:307
