msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Introspection-and-analysis/Security/Introducing-ros2-security.rst:309
msgid ""
"To use ``ros2cli`` to iterate with ROS 2 secured network, you need to "
"provide it with override enclave by ``ROS_SECURITY_ENCLAVE_OVERRIDE`` "
